meta {
  name: GET climate status (3.0.2 app path, read fallback)
  type: http
  seq: 53
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/v1/vehicles/{{vin}}/climate/status
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The path the SEAT and CUPRA 3.0.2 apps use for the climate state. The
  integration still reads /v1/vehicles/{vin}/climatisation/status first
  (50_GET_climatisation_status.bru) and calls this path only when that one
  answers 404 (seat_cupra.py, _read_climate_status_app_path).

  The response form is not documented in the app audit. The integration
  uses an answer only when it carries climatisationState, directly or under
  climatisationStatus or status; anything else is ignored. Whether the
  server still serves the legacy path, and what this one returns, is
  unmeasured.
}
